 },
 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早上好么。",
   "raw_sha256": "c9d70b4daa08caffd47a8a891de9beb4327007ffe404b256c701df5ed1f3d41a",
   "seconds": 2.13,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今儿个的日头，已经悄悄爬到窗台上咧。",
   "raw_sha256": "2c3cc1a2b605387d77934b63b347074c64edd224bda27c9bee7ea3d41e030616",
   "seconds": 4.116,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你夜个交代的事，额都记在心上咧。",
   "raw_sha256": "d5a778a219fec897dbbb5815a4b8391a878070aa1f1688a951990e8f130d0db6",
   "seconds": 3.807,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今儿先嫑急着忙，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "4cff91449b18b8aa124171689cc7ba0e2e7d029bf03868bd2ba50ecf0887fa8c",
   "seconds": 3.612,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "给额说，你夜黑睡得咋样？",
   "raw_sha256": "2d79603da092c42f8946034a883f6bbe36da603127b491210a243bf48a216f0d",
   "seconds": 2.863,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "要是还想赖床，额就轻轻陪你谝一会儿。",
   "raw_sha256": "f984864034ec5253382867949009ff0d0f9d7fa5cc06c877c6591e8212fcca6a",
   "seconds": 4.114,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你收拾停当了，咱再一搭看看，今儿最要紧的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "150efb759b232a118742cba697b601ac5ab8b4c26c00a9a6eb04be94383508fc",
   "seconds": 6.056,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，额就不言传；",
   "raw_sha256": "2f2ec650d19b438b89cfed5d6cf685c22a2258e34deac1e5a53ba618ce555779",
   "seconds": 2.912,
   "pause_ms": 382
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，额就陪你慢慢谝。",
   "raw_sha256": "35e585ba0d7e0199179c97cf6d4db23282052e60d9b6b4f0da3adb3fd20c5ae1",
   "seconds": 3.433,
   "pause_ms": 546
  }
 ],
